{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/architecture/path-boundaries","title":"Folder path boundaries","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"folder-path-boundaries","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Folder path boundaries"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" applies architectural allowlists and denylists to paths"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inside one application. It checks graph dependencies, and can optionally check"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"calls:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"keepFeaturePathsInTheirLanes","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"graph"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ArchitectureGraph","kind":"type"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"assertPathBoundaries","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph.graph, {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    constraints: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        source: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'src/app/features/:feature/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        onlyDependOn: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"'src/app/features/:feature/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"'src/app/shared/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          "},{"text":"'src/app/ui/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-it-prevents","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What it prevents"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Without a folder rule, these imports are easy to introduce:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"features/users → features/cart"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"ui/widget      → data/users-api"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The first couples sibling features. The second lets presentation code bypass"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the domain or browser-boundary service. Both can work today and make tomorrow's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"move or replacement expensive."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":":feature"},{"t":"text","text":" capture permits a feature to depend on its own folder while"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"forbidding a sibling. A denylist such as "},{"t":"code","text":"features/**"},{"t":"text","text":" would accidentally forbid"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"self-dependencies too."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"why-this-is-not-just-eslint","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Why this is not just ESLint"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nx "},{"t":"code","text":"depConstraints"},{"t":"text","text":" protect project-to-project imports. This rule protects"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"folders within an app, including routes, services and components that belong to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same Nx project. Structural edges such as "},{"t":"code","text":"loads"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"renders"},{"t":"text","text":" are ignored;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the rule is about ownership and dependency flow."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/craft-graph-vs-nx","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft graph vs Nx"}]}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#writing-your-own-rules","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Writing your own rules"}]}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"what-it-prevents","text":"What it prevents"},{"level":2,"id":"why-this-is-not-just-eslint","text":"Why this is not just ESLint"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See also"}]}